        "jsonOutput": "=/**\n * Increments retry metadata for the current failed workflow attempt.\n *\n * The expression:\n * - increases `retryCount` by 1 (starting from 0 if missing),\n * - stores the most relevant error message,\n * - writes an ISO timestamp for when the retry state was updated.\n *\n * Intended for n8n expression mode in an Edit Fields / Set node.\n *\n * @returns \n *   retryCount: number,\n *   errorMessage: string,\n *   errorTimestamp: string\n * Normalized retry state for downstream retry logic.\n */\n{{ {\n  \"retryCount\": Number($json.retryCount || 0) + 1,\n  \"errorMessage\": $json.error?.message || $json.errorMessage || \"Unknown agent error\",\n  \"errorTimestamp\": new Date().toISOString()\n} }}",
